        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "truth-serum:1xzl5wg",
          "html": "Open the door to her shop and stand in the doorway, then use your <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rose-tinted_lens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">rose-tinted lens</a> on the counter. Successfully doing so grants you a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Truth_serum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">truth serum</a> potion.",
          "text": "Open the door to her shop and stand in the doorway, then use your rose-tinted lens on the counter. Successfully doing so grants you a truth serum potion.",
